 1.25rem; color: #ff6b00;\"><strong>Total Amount:</strong> PKR 700</p>\n          </div>\n        "}','{"id":"e5ec483b-2007-464e-96b5-e20383d1d77d"}',NULL,'2026-06-27 18:27:22');
