ont-size: 1.25rem; color: #ff6b00;\"><strong>Total Amount:</strong> PKR 1,200</p>\n          </div>\n        "}','{"id":"a3c44eac-0b17-40a8-8fd1-4e4eebf7da6e"}',NULL,'2026-07-09 09:30:25');
