            <p style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; color: #ff6b00;\"><strong>Total Amount:</strong> PKR 700</p>\n          </div>\n        "}','{"id":"0ef7da3e-f366-4071-a083-b417b57f88f4"}',NULL,'2026-07-16 00:23:30');
