25rem; color: #ff6b00;\"><strong>Total Amount:</strong> PKR 700</p>\n          </div>\n        "}','{"id":"9014d104-4cf2-4868-bdfc-a984f0415d7c"}',NULL,'2026-07-24 18:06:01');
