package with care.\r\n                            </p>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Content Body Section -->\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td class=\"content-body\" style=\"padding: 24px 32px 32px 32px;\">\r\n                            <p style=\"font-family: ''Outfit'', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ''Segoe UI'', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: #222222; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px 0;\">\r\n                                Hi <strong style=\"color: #111111; font-weight: 600;\">Amber Baber</strong>,\r\n                            </p>\r\n                            <p style=\"font-family: ''Outfit'', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ''Segoe UI'', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: #4a4a4a; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px 0;\">\r\n                                Thank you for shopping with Gionee Pakistan. We have received your order <strong style=\"color: #ff6b00; font-weight: 600;\">#GPK07143</strong>. Here is a summary of your purchased items.\r\n                            </p>\r\n                            \r\n                            <!-- Order Summary Box -->\r\n                            <div class=\"order-summary-card\" style=\"background-color: #fafbfc; border: 1px solid #f0f1f4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n                                <h2 style=\"font-family: ''Outfit'', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ''Segoe UI'', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8a8d99; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-weight: 700;\">\r\n                                    Order Summary\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                \r\n                                <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\r\n                                    <thead>\r\n         